    s: ["This is Tom and his wife.|Estos son Tom y su mujer.", "Her name is Emma.|Ella se llama Emma.", "Their house is small.|Su casa es pequeña.", "Max is Jack's dog.|Max es el perro de Jack.", "Our cousins are from Bristol.|Nuestros primos son de Brístol."],
