    v: ["I think=creo que", "I expect=supongo que", "I doubt=dudo que", "look at those clouds=mira esas nubes", "editor=editor", "timetable=horario", "the train leaves=el tren sale", "electric=eléctrico", "as usual=como siempre"],
    s: ["I think cars will be electric.|Creo que los coches serán eléctricos.", "Look at those clouds. It's going to rain.|Mira esas nubes. Va a llover.", "I'm meeting my editor at ten.|He quedado con mi editora a las diez.", "The train leaves at 9.15.|El tren sale a las 9.15.", "I doubt a robot will write this.|Dudo que un robot escriba esto."],
