    s: ["If I had gone to university, I would have studied architecture.|Si hubiera ido a la universidad, habría estudiado arquitectura.", "I wouldn't have met my wife.|No habría conocido a mi mujer.", "If I had known, I would have told you.|Si lo hubiera sabido, te lo habría dicho.", "We would never have spoken.|Nunca habríamos hablado.", "If we had left earlier, we wouldn't have missed the train.|Si hubiéramos salido antes, no habríamos perdido el tren."],
