    s: ["I wish I had learnt to play the piano.|Ojalá hubiera aprendido a tocar el piano.", "I wish I hadn't said that.|Ojalá no hubiera dicho eso.", "If only we had left earlier!|¡Ojalá hubiéramos salido antes!", "If I had done everything differently, I wouldn't be here now.|Si lo hubiera hecho todo de otra manera, ahora no estaría aquí.", "It's a pity you couldn't come.|Es una pena que no pudieras venir."],
